# Google Maps Platform API Key
# Never commit your real .env file or hardcode API keys in source files.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Quickstart: Free Maps Demo Key (Prototyping, No Billing Required)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Open: https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any personal Google account (no credit card required).
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted.
# 4. Generate and copy your Maps Demo Key.
# 5. Copy this file to .env (`cp .env.example .env`) and paste your key above.
#
# Supported APIs on the Demo Key include: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New),
# and Routes API (subject to daily prototype quota limits; not for production).
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Production Setup: Restricted Google Cloud API Key
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# When moving to production, create a key in Google Cloud Console:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), and Routes API.
# Restrict your key by HTTP referrer (browser) / server IP and API restrictions:
# https://docs.cloud.google.com/api-keys/docs/add-restrictions-api-keys?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
